# P7-1: Settings > Developer > Display lab. The four patterns; Checker and White are Fast passes (the ghost test), Clean is the Quality pass.
wait 300
tap 140 700             # launcher: Settings
wait 600
tap 270 748             # Developer
wait 900
tap 270 180             # Display lab
wait 900
shot lab-ramp
tap 200 164             # Checker
wait 300
expect-no-quality
shot lab-checker
tap 330 164             # White: after a Fast pass over the checkerboard
wait 300
expect-no-quality
shot lab-white
tap 450 164             # Text
wait 900
shot lab-text
tap 140 880             # Clean (Quality)
wait 2500
shot lab-cleaned
